# DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST & ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES

## Quick Setup for Production

### 1. Backend Configuration (backend/.env)
```
# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://user:password@host:5432/dbname

# URLs
API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
FRONTEND_URL=https://yourdomain.com
BOT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/webhook/telegram

# Telegram
ADMIN_ID=YOUR_TELEGRAM_ID_HERE
BOT_TOKEN=YOUR_BOT_TOKEN_HERE

# Security
SECRET_KEY=GENERATE_NEW_RANDOM_KEY_HERE
ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30

# Settings
TIMEZONE=UTC
ENVIRONMENT=production
DEBUG=False
```

### 2. Frontend Configuration (frontend/.env)
```
# API
VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1

# Telegram
VITE_ADMIN_ID=YOUR_TELEGRAM_ID_HERE

# Settings
VITE_ENVIRONMENT=production
VITE_APP_TITLE=Developer Call Scheduler
```

