## IMPORTANT: Security Reminders

✅ Change SECRET_KEY (don't use default)
✅ Set ENVIRONMENT=production
✅ Set DEBUG=False
✅ Use HTTPS (SSL/TLS)
✅ Keep BOT_TOKEN secret (rotate if exposed)
✅ Update ADMIN_ID to your Telegram ID
✅ Use environment variables, not hardcoded values
✅ Set proper database credentials
✅ Configure CORS properly (not just `*`)

---

## URLs at a Glance

```
Frontend:     FRONTEND_URL (frontend/.env is used by docker-compose)
Backend API:  API_URL + BOT_WEBHOOK_URL (for bot updates)
Frontend API: VITE_API_URL (what frontend calls)
Bot Webhook:  BOT_WEBHOOK_URL (where Telegram sends updates)
```

All four must be accessible and properly configured for production.

